# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the Pi
# (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). git holds only the seed for a fresh
# install. Edit on the Pi (no TUI screen yet), then `sudo pf apply`.
#
# Repositories the agent segment may push to over git smart HTTP:
#   <host> <owner>/<repo>    one repo; a ".git" suffix is ignored
#   <host> <owner>/*         every repo exactly one segment below owner
# Owner and repo match case-insensitively. The host must match exactly. A
# GitLab subgroup is the full path: `gitlab.com grp/sub/repo`, `gitlab.com grp/sub/*`.
#
# Empty means no pushes. This is the default. The fence refuses the
# info/refs advertisement and the pack POST of each git-receive-pack
# with its uniform 503. It logs them to strip.jsonl as
# git_push_not_allowed. Clone and fetch do not change.
#
# This list is not the full write path: the scope of the token is. Refer
# to docs/git_push.md for what the list does not cover.
#
# github.com acme/widget
